   "install": {
    "title": "Getting Started",
    "html": "<p>Take a look at the <a href=\"https://docs.syncthing.net/intro/getting-started.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">getting started guide</a>.</p>\n<p>There are a few examples for keeping Syncthing running in the background\non your system in <a href=\"https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/blob/main/etc\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">the etc directory</a>. There are also several <a href=\"https://docs.syncthing.net/users/contrib.html#gui-wrappers\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GUI\nimplementations</a> for Windows, Mac, and Linux.</p>",
